      Bit Script","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.2150943,"g":0.7886792,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"d517bd58-f569-4bce-af13-adfd3f5a0cfc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":1199.091,"yMin":-369.9091,"xMax":2086.364,"yMax":356.1819},"label":"Options","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.441958,"g":0.645283,"b":0.5798062,"a":1.0},"guid":"1e4d0525-524d-4b5b-b7c3-18feace35d69","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":3652.818,"yMin":-580.3636,"xMax":5039.243,"yMax":808.3249},"label":"30
      Bit Script","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.8264151,"g":0.6923358,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"df6abfd5-bf58-48d3-a785-1151bdd62ae0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-395.7142,"yMin":-368.5714,"xMax":1161.429,"yMax":1316.172},"label":"Dialogue
      Act1","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.2815023,"g":0.781132,"b":0.283183,"a":1.0},"guid":"ad00cb96-2f74-48cf-94a6-84af82c07cd9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":5191.5,"yMin":-597.4999,"xMax":6663.279,"yMax":778.7224},"label":"0
      bits","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.6754716,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"8912f925-a667-4315-a954-bf4471d5de1f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-402.0,"yMin":-857.0,"xMax":290.0,"yMax":-419.0},"label":"TextBox
      Set Active","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.3325295,"g":0.4792453,"b":0.3029192,"a":1.0},"guid":"ec713680-c2fd-45dd-a9ac-86c2d071c275","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":1543.0,"yMin":87.0,"xMax":1900.0,"yMax":202.0},"title":"Options
      Script","body":"Once the Dialogue_Counter reaches the last integer of it''s
      list, in this instance that integer will equal ''9''\n\nThen the GameObject
      ''OPTIONS'' will be set to Active.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"8f0cf9d3-42d2-4a4b-ae9f-fdaf818110eb","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-468.0,"yMin":-234.0,"xMax":-266.0,"yMax":52.0},"title":"Mouse
      Active Script","body":"\nTo \"click\" through the dialogue\n\nMouse Active
      has to equal the amount the Dia_Active in order to cycle through the list.\n\nEXAMPLE:\nVar_MouseActive
      = 0\nVar_IntroDia_Activ = 0\nCLICK through Dialogue and Name\n\nVar_MouseActive
      = 0\nVar_IntroDia_Activ = 1\nCANNOT CLICK through Dialogue and Name","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"a905433b-2ec3-4cfe-9159-b7faa01e7480","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":311.0,"yMin":-216.0,"xMax":468.0,"yMax":90.00006},"title":"Intro_Dia
      Script","body":"The Character and Dialogue Script\n\nYou have to have an AOT
      list Game Object of your Dialogue and Character Names in order for this to
      work\n\nWith each click of Dialogue the Counter is adding 1 to its value, once
      the Counter = the set number it will display the String from the list via the
      TMP Game Object","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"e24764f2-a112-485f-a43b-f3c23479318c","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":31.0,"yMin":230.0,"xMax":174.0001,"yMax":362.9999},"title":"Counter","body":"The
      Counter counts the list as a string and integer value so that you can equal
      or add variables","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"62779cc1-1e6d-41f2-833e-4dccf116cf00","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2345.0,"yMin":-232.0,"xMax":2484.0,"yMax":-83.0},"title":"Turn
      off the Buttons","body":"When Player clicks \"Nah-\"(first option-60 bits)
      then the GameObject OPTIONS will turn off","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"5c98d958-ea85-4b28-813b-1d44411273e0","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":3351.0,"yMin":-196.0,"xMax":3546.0,"yMax":-44.0},"title":"Mouse
      Active +3","body":"Once player clicks button then GameObject shuts off\n\nThen
      a value of ''3'' will be added to Mouse Active switching the Mouse Input from
      the Intro_Dialogue to the 60bits_Dialogue","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"76f67374-32e6-4904-ba9a-cc5dee1db541","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2220.0,"yMin":-512.0,"xMax":3006.0,"yMax":-424.4},"title":"\"60
      Bit\" script","body":"Once the options are on display, there will be 3 buttons
      on the screen. 60 bits is the first option with the starting word of \"Nah.\"\n\nThis
      option will need a player value/score of 60 in order to click this option","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"764c1e22-da6a-4c2e-804e-17c5519ad1dd","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":2495.0,"yMin":136.0,"xMax":2712.6,"yMax":218.4},"title":"Mouse
      Active = 3","body":"Mouse Active has to = 3 in order for the 60bit_Dialogue
      to turn on and be able to click through.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"81cfa660-6d31-4468-a8b0-b5459c45b0c5","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":4760.0,"yMin":-107.0,"xMax":4940.0,"yMax":-43.0},"title":"Same
      Script as Intro_Dia","body":null,"colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"cdac377d-f1ed-4c6e-baaf-579bf3438f75","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":6402.0,"yMin":-58.0,"xMax":6582.0,"yMax":6.0},"title":"Same
      Script as Intro_Dia","body":null,"colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"d658b831-b44f-4110-bd73-50cb5938e8d7","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":3669.0,"yMin":-400.0,"xMax":3890.778,"yMax":-336.0},"title":"Same
      Script as 60 Bit, Different Integer Value","body":null,"colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"cf949c7b-40af-4499-92f8-fa507703849f","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":4819.0,"yMin":-405.0,"xMax":4978.556,"yMax":-341.0},"title":"Mouse
      Active + 2","body":"","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"e60ab164-df8c-487b-9b59-6759467b5091","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":3974.0,"yMin":-76.0,"xMax":4218.111,"yMax":2.666656},"title":"MouseActive
      = 2 for Dialogue","body":null,"colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"d585c120-f6cd-4d7b-98fb-1f11d1f8ced6","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":5210.0,"yMin":-423.0,"xMax":5432.0,"yMax":-359.0},"title":"Same
      Script as 60 Bit, Different Integer Value","body":null,"colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"537f0e63-ddc0-4a87-91be-dc44530aa5d4","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":3351.0,"yMin":108.0,"xMax":3531.0,"yMax":172.0},"title":"Same
      Script as Intro_Dia","body":null,"colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"0737b6dd-76c5-4d32-acc7-fd6f35525130","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":6353.0,"yMin":-365.0,"xMax":6513.0,"yMax":-301.0},"title":"Mouse
      Active + 1","body":"","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"586e06fb-df30-4126-a8ba-7ba9122119e7","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":5562.0,"yMin":-12.0,"xMax":5806.0,"yMax":67.0},"title":"MouseActive
      = 1 for Dialogue","body":null,"colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"cd0bc0de-35de-4f30-a301-83564a392d0d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
